   147	    same (left) room; the other (right) room is otherwise empty.
   148	    Reward + termination on opening the door (see `rewards.on_door_open`/
   149	    `terminations.on_door_open`) - not on reaching any further goal,
   150	    opening the door *is* the success condition."""
